        {
          "@type": "oa:TextQuoteSelector",
          "oa:exact": "When an injury or illness involves one or more days away from work, you must record the injury or illness on the OSHA 300 Log with a check mark in the space for cases involving days away and an entry of the number of calendar days away from work in the number of days column."
        },
