ed to work on the weekend, you need to record this case only if you receive information from a physician or other licensed health care professional indicating that the employee should not have worked, or should have performed only restricted work, during the weekend; if so, you must record the injury or illness as a case with days away from work or restricted work, and enter the day counts, as appropriate.\",\"target_ids\":[],\"term_refs\":[],\"typed_values\":[]}",
