u may stop counting days away from work or days of restriction/job transfer.\"],\"scope_text\":\"if the employee leaves your company for some reason unrelated to the injury or illness, such as retirement, a plant closing, or to take another job\",\"section_id\":\"section-1\",\"start\":5846,\"summary\":\"If the employee leaves your company for some reason unrelated to the injury or illness, such as retirement, a plant closing, or to take another job, you may stop counting days away from work or days of restriction/job transfer.\",\"target_ids\":[],\"term_refs\":[],\"typed_values\":[]}",
