ust record the case.\"],\"scope_text\":\"If the restriction from you or the physician or other licensed health care professional keeps the employee from performing one or more of his or her routine job functions, or from working the full workday the injured or ill employee would otherwise have worked\",\"section_id\":\"section-1\",\"start\":9006,\"summary\":\"If the restriction from you or the physician or other licensed health care professional keeps the employee from performing one or more of his or her routine job functions, or from working the full workday the injured or ill employee would otherwise have worked, the employee's work has been restricted and you must record the case.\",\"target_ids\":[],\"term_refs\":[\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:term:cabbca0c0216f3f05b156b97a4083968cb5297c8d87460039c07b6a8ae898132\"],\"typed_values\":[]}",
