        {
          "@type": "oa:TextQuoteSelector",
          "oa:exact": "(vi) If the injured or ill worker produces fewer goods or services than he or she would have produced prior to the injury or illness but otherwise performs all of the routine functions of his or her work, is the case considered a restricted work case?"
        },
