      "rkaf:assertsValue": {
        "@value": "If you are not clear about the physician or other licensed health care professional's recommendation, such as vague restrictions to engage only in 'light duty' or 'take it easy for a week', you may ask that person whether the employee can do all of his or her routine job functions and work all of his or her normally assigned work shift.",
